    ],
    "text": "CENTRAL PROVINCIAL COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.61,
      414.01,
      494.57,
      439.96
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS UNDER SECTION 47 (1) OF THE EARLY CHILDHOOD DEVELOPMENTCHARTER No. 03 OF 2015 OF THE CENTRAL PROVINCIAL COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      471.61,
      547.1,
      494.68
    ],
    "text": "I, Sarath Ekenayeke, Chief Minister of Central Province, impose the following regulations as per the powers vested in me bysection 47 (1) of the early childhood development charter No. 03 of 2015 of the Central Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.61,
      507.61,
      527.64,
      614.68
    ],
    "text": "SARATH EKENAYEKE,The Chief Minister andMinister of Finance, Planning, Law and Order,Local Government and Provincial Administration,Manpower, Education and Cultural Affairs,Tourism, Land, Trade and Commerce, Food Supplies andDistribution, Investment Coordination andsubjects which are not taken under any otherMinistry of Central Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      639.61,
      196.91,
      686.68
    ],
    "text": "At the Chief Minister\u2019s Office,Central Provincial Council Complex,Pallekele,03rd September, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.53,
      774.71,
      317.25,
      783.57
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.53,
      762.35,
      161.24,
      771.21
    ],
    "text": "1A \u2013 PG4230 \u2013 12 (09/2018)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.91,
      84.49,
      526.7,
      107.73
    ],
    "text": "2AIV ^w& fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2018'09'17PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S RI LANKA \u2013 17.09.2018",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.11,
      115.09,
      517.28,
      138.16
    ],
    "text": "IMPOSING REGULATIONS REGARDING THE ESTABLISHMENT OF DEVELOPMENTSOCIETIES IN EARLY CHILDHOOD DEVELOPMENT CENTERS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.71,
      151.09,
      539.91,
      186.16
    ],
    "text": "1. Following regulations are imposed as follows for the establishment of development societies with theintention of productively utilizing human resource for the qualitative, quantitative and structuraldevelopment of early childhood development centers.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.71,
      240.49,
      539.87,
      264.04
    ],
    "text": "2. Development society of the early childhood development center shall be a structure that focuses onthe sustainability of the center comprising of its management, instructors and parents.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.71,
      306.01,
      539.89,
      329.56
    ],
    "text": "3.(a) Using the development society to improve the quality of the center through development of itsphysical and learning environment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      368.53,
      517.29,
      379.6
    ],
    "text": "(b) Assisting the management to ensure the responsibility and accountability of the center.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.99,
      393.49,
      431.0,
      404.56
    ],
    "text": "(c) Assisting the management to act with transparency and flexibility.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      418.45,
      539.89,
      442.0
    ],
    "text": "(d) Assisting the management to make decisions on a logical basis through participationmanagement.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.99,
      456.01,
      534.47,
      467.08
    ],
    "text": "(e) Prioritizing the basic requirements of the center and influencing the society to achieve them.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      154.27,
      480.97,
      539.91,
      504.52
    ],
    "text": "(f) Influencing the center towards development approaches with decision making and planningstrategies based on data and information.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      518.53,
      539.86,
      542.08
    ],
    "text": "(g) Improving the productivity of the center by strengthening the mutual relationship among parentsof the children.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      555.97,
      539.89,
      579.52
    ],
    "text": "(h) Assisting to ensure the existence and functioning of the early childhood development centerthrough its main objectives.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      153.43,
      593.53,
      539.85,
      604.6
    ],
    "text": "(i) Actively assisting in the process of creating public awareness on early childhood development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      131.71,
      618.49,
      539.89,
      642.04
    ],
    "text": "4.(a) A development society must be established in each early childhood development center operatingin the central province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      655.93,
      539.86,
      679.6
    ],
    "text": "(b) Each such development society should be registered under the early childhood developmentunit of Central province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.99,
      693.49,
      453.43,
      704.56
    ],
    "text": "(c) Office bearers shall carry out all the administrative affairs of the society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.27,
      718.45,
      539.86,
      742.0
    ],
    "text": "(d) An odd number of executive members, proportionate to the number of children in the center canbe decided as per the decision made at a general meeting of the society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.19,
      153.23,
      107.48,
      229.29
    ],
    "text": "Regulations fortheestablishment ofdevelopmentsocieties in EarlyChildhoodDevelopmentSocieties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.19,
      239.63,
      107.48,
      296.49
    ],
    "text": "Structure ofdevelopmentsocieties in EarlyChildhoodDevelopmentSocieties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.19,
      306.83,
      107.48,
      363.69
    ],
    "text": "Objectives ofestablishingdevelopmentsocieties in EarlyChildhoodDevelopment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      48.19,
      619.07,
      105.08,
      656.73
    ],
    "text": "Establishing theEarly childhoodDevelopmentSociety.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      68.25,
      85.09,
      546.57,
      107.73
    ],
    "text": "IV ^w& fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2018'09'17PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S RI LANKA \u2013 17.09.20183A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "FMAbhaya",
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      115.45,
      475.26,
      139.0
    ],
    "text": "(e) Only the director of early childhood development unit of central province or his representativecan supervise, acquire information from and participate at the development societies.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      66.45,
      152.89,
      454.19,
      163.96
    ],
    "text": "5.(a) Parents of each child enrolled in the center is eligible for the membership of this society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      190.45,
      475.18,
      214.0
    ],
    "text": "(b) The office bearers of the society shall comprise of a Chairman, Vice Chairman, Secretary, AssistantSecretary, Treasurer, Accounts Inspector and Society Members.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      227.89,
      475.15,
      238.96
    ],
    "text": "(c) Manager/Owner, instructors and assistant instructors shall be ex-officio members of the society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      252.85,
      414.51,
      263.92
    ],
    "text": "(d) The posts of Secretary and Treasurer shall be given to the Parents of children.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      277.93,
      475.22,
      301.48
    ],
    "text": "(e) When appointing members for key posts they should equally represent the area under thepurview of the society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      88.89,
      315.37,
      475.22,
      326.44
    ],
    "text": "(f) The Chief Instructor of the early childhood development center shall become ex-offcio Chairman.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      66.45,
      339.37,
      475.24,
      362.08
    ],
    "text": "6. (a) The objectives of the society\u2019s constitution shall be the same as that of the objectives mentionedin regulation No. 03.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      386.17,
      466.22,
      397.24
    ],
    "text": "(b) Each development society shall adopt a constitution that is approved at a general meeting.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      409.57,
      475.21,
      432.28
    ],
    "text": "(c) Each development society should have a constitution that includes all the provisions regardingapponting and removal of officers and holding annual, general and other meetings.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      444.61,
      475.17,
      467.44
    ],
    "text": "(d) When an office bearer resigns or secedes, all the doucuments in his possession must be dulyreturned as stated in the society\u2019s constitution.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      479.77,
      475.18,
      502.48
    ],
    "text": "(e) If objectives other than those stated in regulation No. 03 are to be included in the society\u2019sconstitution, they should not contradict the aforementioned.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      88.89,
      514.81,
      464.63,
      525.88
    ],
    "text": "(f)(i) Any amendment or repeal to the constitution can only by done at the general meeting.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      104.61,
      538.21,
      475.23,
      561.04
    ],
    "text": "(ii) In order to amend or repeal the constitution, a majority of 2/3 of votes from the total numberof members is needed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      573.37,
      475.22,
      596.08
    ],
    "text": "(g) Provisions regarding extraordinary meetings and other meetings as decided at the generalmeeting may be included in the constitution.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      66.45,
      608.41,
      475.24,
      631.24
    ],
    "text": "7.(a) When preparing the constitution, the registered name of the centre should come first and itshould be followed by the term \u2018\u2018Development Society\u2019\u2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      666.97,
      423.46,
      678.04
    ],
    "text": "(b) The address of the society must be the same as that of the address of the center.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      86.61,
      690.37,
      424.93,
      701.44
    ],
    "text": "(c) The official term of office bearers of the society shall limit to a period of one year.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      66.45,
      713.77,
      297.39,
      724.84
    ],
    "text": "8. Following decisions can be made at a general meeting :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      85.89,
      737.17,
      370.93,
      748.24
    ],
    "text": "(a) Holding an inaugural meeting to implement the tasks of the society.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      487.17,
      153.35,
      539.62,
      181.41
    ],
    "text": "Membership ofthe societyOffice bearers.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      487.17,
      340.67,
      540.46,
      387.93
    ],
    "text": "Constitution ofthe EarlyChildhoodDevelopmentSociety.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
